  "contentHtml": "<p>&#160;</p><p>감각 기관 공부하면서 아이들과&#160;&#160;</p><p>점자를 공부해 보고 싶다는 생각을 했었는데..</p><p>드디어 올해 성공했습니다.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>볼로기 라고 하는 휴대용 점자 만드는 아주 간단한 장치가 있어요.</p><p>검색해보시면 금방 찾으실 겁니다.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>그거 사다가 아이들과 점자 공부하고&#160;</p><p>자기 이름 점자로 만들어보기 했어요.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>자기 이름이라서 그런가 아무도 버리고 가지 않고 소중히 챙겨 가더라고요.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>그리고 마지막에는 조마다 &quot;7글자&quot;로 된 점자를 만들게 하고 옆 조 친구들이 그 점자를 해독(?)하게 했습니다.&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p><p>학기말에 하기에도 아주 좋은 활동입니다.</p><p>&#160;</p><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/31fe9b3178132cf1979b0b166108ac4c250788ae\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/31fe9b3178132cf1979b0b166108ac4c250788ae\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/17fa13cb074e054df733c683dddefa88410629df\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/17fa13cb074e054df733c683dddefa88410629df\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9b68af8b5c6febcdaa2c3f8dadf7427c76475932\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9b68af8b5c6febcdaa2c3f8dadf7427c76475932\" data-origin-width=\"1080\" data-origin-height=\"1440\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/91e2f13f4f4d49bbe8a803ced6037bc618c38355\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/91e2f13f4f4d49bbe8a803ced6037bc618c38355\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7b6496c0da350a67498f0c68196b9930cd1b2a80\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/7b6496c0da350a67498f0c68196b9930cd1b2a80\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9da92cd3966e367d8ed500929e7a79e14e7a25d3\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/9da92cd3966e367d8ed500929e7a79e14e7a25d3\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2ac5ccb273797b74f0d7dfc5e3a904e197da26f6\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/2ac5ccb273797b74f0d7dfc5e3a904e197da26f6\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5dafa20b3fac2c8fa58645c5a876658af5eeb060\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/5dafa20b3fac2c8fa58645c5a876658af5eeb060\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><div class=\"figure-img\" data-ke-type=\"image\" data-ke-style=\"alignCenter\" data-ke-mobilestyle=\"widthOrigin\"><img src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4f810aad070e5dec343ced41df01e173d1568020\" class=\"txc-image\" data-img-src=\"https://t1.daumcdn.net/cafeattach/1TaBA/4f810aad070e5dec343ced41df01e173d1568020\" data-origin-width=\"1440\" data-origin-height=\"1080\"></div><p>&#160;</p><p>팁 좀 드리자면...&#160;</p><p>아이들에게 큰 쟁반을 주고 그 위에서 하라고 해야 분실 방지가 될 거 같아요.</p><p>&#160;</p><p>쟁반 위에서 하라고 해도 참말로 말을 안 듣기는 합니다!!! ㅎㅎ</p><p>&#160;</p><p>&#160;</p>\n\t \t\t\t\t\t<!-- -->",
